ModelForge public alpha third-party notices
===========================================

The base `modelforge_workbench` runtime contains no vendored third-party Python
or JavaScript library, model, dataset, weight, checkpoint, brand asset, or
generated media. Python is supplied by the user's installation. Setuptools and
wheel are build tools; pytest, Ruff, build, and Twine are development tools and
are not included in the wheel.

The wheel stages four selected project-integration source groups for
rights-holder review. Seventeen independently authored Python files remain
`LicenseRef-ModelForge-Pending`. Two BDD100K files adapt MeMOTR inference flow.
`inference_runtime.py` is classified
`MIT AND LicenseRef-ModelForge-Pending`; `inference_helpers.py` is classified
`MIT AND Apache-2.0 AND LicenseRef-ModelForge-Pending` because its upstream
